    "updated_at": "2026-11-14T22:17:09Z",
    "body": "Stopping without claiming #904 because every item on this umbrella is either merged on `upstream/main` or tracked in its own open sub-issue.\n\nAlready merged on `upstream/main`:\n- `27b5e040` (PR #1064): turning, rotary, and multi-axis ball kinds judged with tightened laws, collision laws (`reach`, `sweep`, `rapids`, `rapids_posed`, turning margins) tightened by excess, and pins for point 6 (`coarse_contain`, `model_excess`).\n- `ec57632d` (PR #1074, #1054 closed): STEP facet budget setting (`import_model`, script verb, model page).\n- `a0d10283` (PR #1127) and `8864176c` (PR #1341, #1056 closed): stock copy fidelity flag, named refusal over sim gouge line, tightened display tolerances, and pre-v59 fidelity-unknown handling.\n- `f72b88a0` (PR #1081, #1053 partial): probe and plasma judged with tightened laws, and cone/engrave rides kept refused with the reason recorded in `crates/app/src/operation/fidelity_law.rs`.\n\nRemaining items are already tracked in open sub-issues:\n- #1052: swarf flank proof on reduced-fidelity models.\n- #1053: cross drill (`cross_part`, `verify/rapids_radial`, and its standoff checks).\n- #1055: metre-unit STEP scaling before meshing.\n\nSince no un-split work remains on #904 itself, the remaining items should be worked via #1052, #1053, and #1055 (or #904 closed as an umbrella by a maintainer).\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
